    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>{{ site.siteName }} ("we", "us", "our") is a business and social development consultancy based in {{ site.location }}. This policy explains how we collect, use and protect personal data when you visit this website or get in touch with us.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Contact details you submit through our contact form or email, such as your name, email address, phone number and organisation.</li>
      <li>Details you choose to share about your organisation when enquiring about our services.</li>
      <li>Basic technical data such as browser type and general location, collected through cookies — see our <a href="/cookie-policy.html">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
      <li>Your email address if you subscribe to our newsletter.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To respond to enquiries and provide the consultancy services you request.</li>
      <li>To send newsletter updates, only if you've opted in, with an unsubscribe link in every email.</li>
      <li>To improve this website based on aggregated, anonymised usage patterns.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell personal data. We do not share it with third parties except the tools we use to run this website and our business (for example, our contact form and email providers), and only as needed to provide our services.</p>

    <h2>Legal basis</h2>
    <p>Under UK GDPR, we rely on your consent (for newsletter sign-ups) and our legitimate interest in responding to enquiries and delivering services you've requested (for contact form submissions).</p>

